!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For each polyp, three biopsies of normal mucosa were collected from the same colon segment (> 2 cm from the site of the polyp). Immediately after removal, a small sample of epithelial tissue (5-15 mg) was cut from the tip of each polyp, leaving the underlying muscularis mucosae intact. Total RNA was extracted (RNeasy Mini kit, Qiagen) from homogenized tissue samples (5- to 15-mg), and its integrity was verified by capillary gel electrophoresis (Bio Analyzer, Agilent Technologies).
!Sample_label_ch1 = biotin
!Sample_label_protocol_ch1 = Biotinylated cRNA were prepared according to the standard Affymetrix protocol from 5 ug total RNA (Expression Analysis Technical Manual, 2001, Affymetrix).
!Sample_hyb_protocol = Following fragmentation, 15 ug of cRNA were hybridized for 16 hr at 45C on HG-133 Plus2.0 Array. GeneChips were washed and stained in the Affymetrix Fluidics Station 450.
!Sample_scan_protocol = standard Affymetrix procedures
!Sample_description = Gene expression data from colorectal adenoma.
